> What am I missing?

A lot of defaults that cfa() turns on but lavaan() leaves off.  cfa() is just a wrapper around lavaan().  Check the call this way:

> fit <- cfa(model = 'latent =~ ind1 + ind2 + ind3 + ind4', data = foo)
> fit@call

Or this way:

> lavInspect(fit, "call")

