From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Fri, 19 Aug 2016 11:03:12 +0000
Subject: Re: Difference in SEM results when raw data or covariance matrix is used as input.
Message-ID: <Gy92jFoGSfw.Vm2UT8pMAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Gy92jFoGSfw.mICiGnJEAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
