From u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com  Mon Aug 22 11:45:20 2016
From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Mon, 22 Aug 2016 11:45:20 +0000
