Hi Jason,
I am sorry, I sent you a wrong answer before. You mean Exploratory SEM, not EFA.

It seems like you can use sem package to fit ESEM. Please consider the below article and link.

http://stats.stackexchange.com/questions/138434/exploratory-structural-equation-model-esem-in-r-exploratory-specification-mod
http://www.annualreviews.org/doi/abs/10.1146/annurev-clinpsy-032813-153700

I have never done this analysis before, but I found this analysis is interesting. Hope other people who know better can help you.
Also, if I found more helpful information, I will send it. Sorry about the confusion.

Another-Mplus can also conduct ESEM according to web resources. It might be helpful if you read their article to understand ESEM.

